<title>USA: Menasha, Wis., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Menasha, Wis., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.275 million of Menasha, Wis., bonds anticipation notes, with a net interest cost of 4.5245 percent.</p>
